    {
      "start": 0.0,
      "end": 7.92,
      "language": "en",
      "speaker": null,
      "text": "The U.N. also hopes to finalize a fund to help countries affected by global warming to cope with the impacts.",
      "source_id": "en:1510:1009709090964908274.wav"
    },
    {
      "start": 8.27,
      "end": 17.75,
      "language": "en",
      "speaker": null,
      "text": "Soon, officers equipped with riot gear entered the yard and cornered the inmates with tear gas.",
      "source_id": "en:1511:10927605878527486298.wav"
    },
    {
      "start": 18.1,
      "end": 31.4,
      "language": "en",
      "speaker": null,
      "text": "This new environment has different resources and different competitors, so the new population will need different features or adaptations to be a strong competitor than what they had needed before.",
      "source_id": "en:1512:7931741157330894890.wav"
    },
    {
      "start": 31.75,
      "end": 37.57,
      "language": "en",
      "speaker": null,
      "text": "Argentina is well known for having one of the best polo teams and players in the world.",
      "source_id": "en:1513:12541283768447528582.wav"
    },
    {
      "start": 37.92,
      "end": 53.22,
      "language": "en",
      "speaker": null,
      "text": "When the fighting ceased after the wounded were transported to the hospital, about 40 of the other remaining inmates stayed in the yard and refused to return to their cells.",
      "source_id": "en:1514:15472366452348613907.wav"
    },
    {
      "start": 53.57,
      "end": 61.61,
      "language": "en",
      "speaker": null,
      "text": "It is Martelly's fifth CEP in four years.",
      "source_id": "en:1515:1894240377480073066.wav"
    },
    {
      "start": 61.96,
      "end": 74.08,
      "language": "en",
      "speaker": null,
      "text": "Please treat the site with all of the dignity, solemnity and respect it deserves. Do not make jokes about the Holocaust or Nazis.",
      "source_id": "en:1516:17606651572533263873.wav"
    },
    {
      "start": 74.43,
      "end": 81.45,
      "language": "en",
      "speaker": null,
      "text": "Research in AI involves making machines to automate tasks that require intelligent behavior.",
      "source_id": "en:1517:10885549230041454053.wav"
    },
    {
      "start": 81.8,
      "end": 93.56,
      "language": "en",
      "speaker": null,
      "text": "A former Filipino policeman has kept Hong Kong tourists hostage by hijacking their bus in Manila, the capital of the Philippines.",
      "source_id": "en:1518:10807778671969097912.wav"
    },
    {
      "start": 93.91,
      "end": 101.95,
      "language": "en",
      "speaker": null,
      "text": "In many cases, enrolling on a gap-year course abroad can actually improve your chances of moving into higher education back in your home country.",
      "source_id": "en:1519:16685771406658302555.wav"
    },
    {
      "start": 102.3,
      "end": 117.24,
      "language": "en",
      "speaker": null,
      "text": "Out of 1,400 people polled prior to the 2010 federal election, those who oppose Australia becoming a republic grew by 8 per cent since 2008.",
      "source_id": "en:1520:608005572552850776.wav"
    },
    {
      "start": 117.59,
      "end": 123.11,
      "language": "en",
      "speaker": null,
      "text": "The satellite in space gets the call and then reflects it back down, almost instantly.",
      "source_id": "en:1521:11840539862172308240.wav"
    }
